flowchart LR
  subgraph LONG[Long-term stores]
    SES[(session summary)]
    FIX[(verified durable memory)]
  end
  subgraph WM[Explicit working-memory slots]
    S1[goal]
    S2[critical constraint]
    S3[current state]
    S4[last surprise/blocker]
  end
  LONG -. retrieve relevant items .-> WM
  STR[Strategist] <-->|read/write| WM
  EXE[Executor] <-->|read/write| WM
  WM -->|relevance-based replacement| DROP[(deferred)]
